{"entries":[{"id":"sebastianraschka-classifier-history-and-jev","sourceId":"sebastianraschka","sourceName":"塞巴斯蒂安·拉施卡 · Ahead of AI","title":"Language Models for Text Classification: From Bag-of-Words to Jev","titleZh":"文本分类的语言模型：从词袋到 Jev","published":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790640000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/sebastianraschka-classifier-history-and-jev/","image":"","summary":"Jev is essentially a text classifier that occupies a practical middle ground between narrow task-specific models and large general-purpose LLMs.","summaryZh":"Jev 本质上是一个文本分类器，它处于狭窄的特定任务模型与大型通用 LLM 之间的实用中间地带。"},{"id":"sebastianraschka-gpt-6-astra-looped-transformers-and","sourceId":"sebastianraschka","sourceName":"塞巴斯蒂安·拉施卡 · Ahead of AI","title":"GPT-6 Astra, Looped Transformers, and Hidden Reasoning","titleZh":"GPT-6 Astra、循环 Transformer 与隐藏推理","published":"2026-09-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1788912000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/sebastianraschka-gpt-6-astra-looped-transformers-and/","image":"","summary":"Looped transformers do not inherently hide reasoning, despite claims that GPT-6 Astra conceals its chain of thought.","summaryZh":"循环 Transformer 架构本身并不会隐藏推理过程，尽管有说法称 GPT-6 Astra 隐藏了其思维链。"},{"id":"sebastianraschka-claude-watermarking","sourceId":"sebastianraschka","sourceName":"塞巴斯蒂安·拉施卡","title":"How Claude Watermarks AI-Generated Text","titleZh":"Claude 如何为 AI 生成的文本添加水印","published":"2026-08-22T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1787356800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/sebastianraschka-claude-watermarking/","image":"","summary":"This article explains the technical mechanism behind Anthropic's watermarking of Claude's AI-generated text, including tokenization, logit distributions, sampling methods, and the subtle modification that allows identification without degrading quality.","summaryZh":"本文解释了 Anthropic 为 Claude 的 AI 生成文本添加水印的技术机制，包括分词、logit 分布、采样方法以及在不降低质量的前提下实现识别的微妙修改。"},{"id":"sebastianraschka-ai-detector-from-scratch","sourceId":"sebastianraschka","sourceName":"塞巴斯蒂安·拉施卡","title":"Building an AI Text Detector From Scratch","titleZh":"从零构建 AI 文本检测器","published":"2026-08-15T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1786752000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/sebastianraschka-ai-detector-from-scratch/","image":"","summary":"A hands-on tutorial on building an AI text detector from scratch, covering fine-tuning DistilBERT and using it as a verifier to train a small language model to avoid detection.","summaryZh":"一篇从零构建 AI 文本检测器的实战教程，涵盖微调 DistilBERT 模型，并探索将其作为验证器训练小型语言模型以规避检测。"},{"id":"sebastianraschka-kimi-k3-architecture-notes","sourceId":"sebastianraschka","sourceName":"塞巴斯蒂安·拉施卡","title":"Kimi K3 Architecture Notes","titleZh":"Kimi K3 架构笔记","published":"2026-07-28T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1785196800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/sebastianraschka-kimi-k3-architecture-notes/","image":"","summary":"Kimi K3 is a scaled-up production version of Kimi Linear, featuring LatentMoE for compressing large linear layers.","summaryZh":"Kimi K3 是 Kimi Linear 的规模化生产版本，采用 LatentMoE 压缩大型线性层。"},{"id":"sebastianraschka-controlling-reasoning-effort","sourceId":"sebastianraschka","sourceName":"塞巴斯蒂安·拉施卡","title":"Controlling Reasoning Effort in LLMs","titleZh":"控制大语言模型中的推理努力程度","published":"2026-07-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1784332800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/sebastianraschka-controlling-reasoning-effort/","image":"","summary":"A new GPT-5.6 model family offers multiple reasoning-effort settings, allowing users to control the trade-off between performance and computational cost.","summaryZh":"新的 GPT-5.6 模型系列提供多种推理努力设置，使用户能够控制性能与计算成本之间的权衡。"},{"id":"sebastianraschka-inkling-architecture-notes","sourceId":"sebastianraschka","sourceName":"塞巴斯蒂安·拉施卡","title":"Inkling: A New Open-Weight 975B MoE with a Few Surprises","titleZh":"Inkling：一款带有若干惊喜的新型开放权重 975B MoE 模型","published":"2026-07-16T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1784160000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/sebastianraschka-inkling-architecture-notes/","image":"","summary":"Inkling is a 975B-parameter open-weight MoE model with 41B active parameters and 1M context, featuring short convolutions and learned relative-position bias instead of RoPE.","summaryZh":"Inkling 是一款 975B 参数开放权重 MoE 模型，激活参数 41B，上下文 1M，采用短卷积和可学习相对位置偏置替代 RoPE。"},{"id":"sebastianraschka-gpt-5-6-configurations","sourceId":"sebastianraschka","sourceName":"塞巴斯蒂安·拉施卡","title":"GPT 5.6 Has 72 Possible Configurations. What's A Good Default?","titleZh":"GPT 5.6 有 72 种可能配置。什么是好的默认设置？","published":"2026-07-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1783555200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/sebastianraschka-gpt-5-6-configurations/","image":"","summary":"GPT 5.6's 72 configurations map onto training-time and inference-time scaling, with Sol, Terra, Luna as model sizes and effort as inference compute.","summaryZh":"GPT 5.6 的 72 种配置可映射到训练时和推理时扩展，其中 Sol、Terra、Luna 代表模型规模，effort 代表推理计算。"},{"id":"sebastianraschka-understanding-reasoning-llms","sourceId":"sebastianraschka","sourceName":"塞巴斯蒂安·拉施卡","title":"Understanding Reasoning LLMs","titleZh":"理解推理型大语言模型","published":"2025-02-05T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1738713600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/sebastianraschka-understanding-reasoning-llms/","image":"","summary":"Reasoning LLMs enhance problem-solving by generating explicit intermediate reasoning steps, but their true potential lies in balancing inference-time computation with training-time optimization.","summaryZh":"推理型大语言模型通过生成显式的中间推理步骤来提升问题解决能力，但其真正潜力在于平衡推理时计算与训练时优化。"}]}